 + `sessions/.../preparation/evaluation/iter1/codex/*.md` (8 files) — iter1 eval findings to address\n\nEmpirical re-verification (you must run yourself):\n- `find .claude/skills/ -type l -name \"*.md\" | wc -l` (should return 53)\n- `ls -la .claude/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md` (should show → ... symlink target)\n- `ls .claude/skills/orchestration/workflow/` (should show 7 .md files)\n\n## Constraints\n\n**In scope** (only the 5 surgical fixes):\n- Fix 1-5 as specified.\n- Empirical re-verification of symlink count + workflow dir contents.\n\n**Out of scope**:\n- Anything beyond the 5 fixes.\n- Re-doing Sub-step A-D.\n- New backlog items.\n- Modifying the 4 unchanged staged files (D-3 planning-brief annotation, D-2 hooks-domain backlog, D-6 lifecycle backlog, D-7 hook-authoring backlog).\n- Mass migration of symlinks (option (b) was rejected — don't propose).\n\n## Your Job\n\n1. Load directives.\n2. FRESHLY READ inputs 1-6.\n3. Run empirical re-verification commands.\n4. Apply Fix 1-5 in order.\n5. Verify WORK exit checklist for iter2:\n   - draft-iter2.md exists with all required sections\n   - Both superseded files have `status: superseded` + supersession reason\n   - New mirror-policy decision file exists with corrected lock\n   - D-4 design file has the 5-vs-7 clarification\n   - Decisions log cites every iter2 fix\n\n## Report Format\n\n```\nSTATUS: <DONE|DONE_WITH_CONCERNS|NEEDS_CONTEXT|BLOCKED>\nARTIFACT: sessions/.../preparation/rawdata/draft-iter2.md\n```\n\nBody: list paths of files created/modified; cite the empirical re-verification result; one-line per fix.","agentId":"a6fd160292b34feec","agentType":"leader","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 5 fixes verified. WORK exit checklist passes.\n\n---\n\n```\nSTATUS: DONE\nARTIFACT: /playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-23-1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac/preparation/rawdata/draft-iter2.md\n```\n\n**Empirical re-verification (run by this leader)**:\n- `find /playinganalyt