cedural reminder is essential for Planning** (per `manager-iter2-brief-failed-iron-law-7-verbatim-spec-recheck.md` — high-severity project mistake from a prior session same week). The 553-line Ideation rawdata is too large for memory-only brief construction; manager must Read freshly when authoring any \"verbatim\" Planning task instruction.\n\n3. **Mirror propagation policy is undefined**: The project has a workspace skill tree at `.claude/skills/` and a project mirror at `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/`. For the session.template.json change and for any orchestration/SKILL.md / git/SKILL.md edits in T1, Planning needs an explicit decision on whether edits propagate to both or only the workspace canonical. Not blocking Preparation, but Planning should AskUserQuestion early.\n\n5 AskUserQuestion cards drafted at the end of the artifact (Cards 1-9 grouped — 5 distinct questions, with the 4 `skip` decisions batched into Card 6). Manager owns presentation."}],"totalDurationMs":246901,"totalTokens":108285,"totalToolUseCount":22,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11481,"cache_read_input_tokens":95529,"output_tokens":1274,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11481},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1274,"cache_read_input_tokens":95529,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11481,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11481,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":14,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":7,"editFileCount":1,"linesAdded":269,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"dc3c1535-f824-4056-aae1-93f96a0cd5c5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/playinganalytics/git/gobbi","sessionId":"1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac","version":"2.1.150","gitBranch":"develop","slug":"noble-fluttering-token"}
