- **Behavior**:\n  - Read resolved `git.workflow.mode` from settings.\n  - If `direct`: **skip** worktree creation (preserves direct-mode escape hatch per D-5; cross-link to T1.g footnote which lives elsewhere — Task 06).\n  - If `worktree-pr`: invoke `git/SKILL.md` Procedure P2 to create worktree.\n  - **Branch name**: `chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}` where `{date}` is the session-start date `YYYY-MM-DD` and `{ssid-short}` is the first 8 chars of `$CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID`.\n  - **Idempotency guard**: if `session.json.git.worktreePath` is already set on resume AND the path exists on disk, `cd` into the existing worktree and skip P2 (handles SessionStart matcher `startup|resume|clear|compact`).\n- **Agent**: manager\n- **Refs**: cite `git/SKILL.md` § P2 + `git/conventions.md` line 22 branch regex + `git/conventions.md` line 64 length constraint.\n\n### Row 6 text update\n\nRow 6's existing text says (paraphrasing): \"if it is `worktree-pr`, leave `git.branch`/`git.worktreePath` as `null` until `git` creates the worktree.\" This is now WRONG because row 5.5 creates the worktree first. Update row 6's wording to: \"stamp `git.branch` and `git.worktreePath` from the worktree just created in row 5.5\" (or similar phrasing that fits the row 6 context).\n\nDo NOT update the agents[] subsection mentioned in row 6 — that's Task 10's scope (T3.d).\n\n### File touched\n\n- `.claude/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md` (this is a symlink → `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md`; editing either path edits the same physical file per Preparation iter3 edit contract). Use the **Edit tool** (preserves inode). **Do NOT use `sed -i`** on the workspace path (would replace symlink).\n\n## Context\n\nThis task is the FIRST task in the Execution wave. L1, no deps. After this lands, L2 tasks (02, 03, 04, 06) can start in parallel-eligible but will run sequentially per workflow contract.\n\nThe session is currently in main tree; the worktree was just created at the path above. You must `cd` to the worktree before any edits.\n\n## Load Directives (in order)\n\n1. Principles: `principles` skill (mandatory; fresh subagents do not inherit)\n2. Rules: All files under `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/rules/`\n3. Skills:\n   - `mistake` skill (mandatory)\n   - `orchestration/workflow/execution.md` (phase doc — Study → Plan → Execute → Verify → Commit lifecycle)\n   - `execution/SKILL.md` (domain — executor procedure)\n   - `git/SKILL.md` (worktree work; commit conventions; AI-Provenance-Record trailer)\n4. Mistakes (per Preparation D-3 binding for T1 task briefs):\n   - `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/codex-eval-session-write-path-nested-in-worktree.md` (worktree write-path discipline — relevant: edits land in worktree, not main tree)\n   - `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/manager-rm-rf-without-investigating-tracked-files.md` (worktree operations safety)\n   - `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/mistakes/manager-iter2-brief-failed-iron-law-7-verbatim-spec-recheck.md` (Iron Law 7 — read spec freshly)\n\n## Inputs (FRESH READ)\n\n1. **Primary spec** (the Plan task definition): `/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-23-1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac/planning/artifacts/plan.md` — Task 01 yaml block + Task table context\n2. **Ideation design decision D-1**: `/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-23-1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac/ideation/rawdata/draft-iter3.md` — find D-1 section for the exact row-5.5 design\n3. **Preparation edit contract**: `/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-23-1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac/preparation/staging/decisions/mirror-propagation-policy-mirror-canonical-symlinks.md` § Symlink-preservation edit contract — for edit-method discipline\n4. **The target file (CURRENT STATE)**: `/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/worktrees/chore/268-session-foundations-bundle-b/.claude/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md` (or canonical mirror path within 