b-step C findings (T2 section + implicit matrix reconstruction in § \"Current implicit role × phase matrix\"); ambiguity surfaced at T2-DQ-2 validator-location question.\n\n2. **`codex-ci-integration-for-dual-system-eval.md`** — Original deferred-list priority #1; substantial standalone item per Sub-step A bundle scope deliberation.\n\n3. **`item-2-1-auto-mode-silence-vs-always-ask.md`** — Auto-mode silence vs Always-Ask categories; explicitly excluded from this session per Sub-step B Scope Contract.\n\n4. **`chat-mode-tiki-taka-redesign.md`** — User explicitly deferred (Sub-step A bundle scope deliberation): \"needs many discussions\"; out of session scope.\n\n5. **`item-1-3-two-surface-collapsing-strategy.md`** — Alternative framing for T1 surfaced by leader in Sub-step A re-framing check (forcing-question 6); user locked worktree-first in CP-1.3-β.\n\n6. **`item-1-3-symlink-into-worktree-alternative.md`** — Alternative framing for T1; same locked-out reason as above.\n\n7. **`item-1-2-broader-delegation-contract-verifier.md`** — Broader re-framing of 1-2 surfaced by leader in Sub-step A CP-1.2-β; would address all gate-bypass patterns (not just Load Directives).\n\n(Also surfaced — already shipping or already filed) — DO NOT create backlog entries for: \"unified event stream\" (re-framing for 4-1 — leader recommended defer; the bundle-shipped T3 hook + reconstructor satisfies the literal ask).\n\n### 1 feature-level backlog item (within session-foundations-bundle-b)\n\n8. **`schema-extension-agents-status-field.md`** at `staging/backlogs/feature/`. Frontmatter same shape. Body: per T3 design D-3-3 + checklist item 7, `session.template.json.agents[]` schema needs a `status` field to formally accept \"failed\" / \"success\" values; deferred to keep this PR scope at docs+hook+script. Includes pointer to T3-DQ-3 + E-1 in Sub-step D design doc.\n\n## Context\n\nThis is the closing WORK phase of Ideation Loop iter 1. All inputs already exist as session-staged artifacts